WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
On the Home screen, click Open project… and choose the project of the first tutorial.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The project opens up to date: nothing is to be computed.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Click Post.

4
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Layers on the left, the picture in the middle, Properties on the right.

5
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The image of the workflow is one layer, Color minimal. Its eye shows or hides it.

6
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Before any gesture: a grey veil over the sky, black lines on the right and bottom edges, a dark spot at the far left.

7
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Drag Sky towards darker, to about −1.5: the grey veil goes.

8
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Drag Faint tones towards brighter, to about +1.0: the outer filaments rise out of the sky.

9
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Click Actual size (1): the pixels at 100 %.

10
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Click Fit (F): the whole picture again.

11
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Open the … menu: Before / after is there.

12
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Click Before / after.

13
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Drag the divider: the layer with its suggested settings on one side, the settings made on the other.

14
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:01.000
Click Crop: the frame appears over the picture.

15
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Click Apply to keep the crop.

16
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:09.000
Drag Contrast towards stronger, to see.

17
00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Press Ctrl+Z: the last change of the page is undone, here Contrast.

18
00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Click Redo (Ctrl+Y): the change comes back.

19
00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:21.000
Click Export…

20
00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:24.000
Choose the file with the folder button.

21
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:29.000
The Format list offers TIFF 16-bit, TIFF 32-bit float, FITS 32-bit float, PNG 16-bit and JPEG.

22
00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:34.000
Size: full resolution, or Web with the longest side at 2048 or 4096 px.

23
00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Include: the processing history is ticked, a file written beside the picture. Layers, masks and the night card are off.

24
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:42.000
Click Export.

25
00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:47.000
The window says how many files were written, and where.

26
00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:51.000
The processing stays in the project: every setting can be changed again.
